  "content": "<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/dynamictrees\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dynamic Trees</a>&nbsp;| <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Twilight Forest</a></h2>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/975/400/the_twilight_forest.png\" alt=\"header\" width=\"1176\" height=\"480\"></h5>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/A4FCBS3\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0Prkr13.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"166\" height=\"32\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>概述</strong></h2>\n<p>此模组使《暮色森林》与 Dynamic Trees 兼容，添加了由该模组支持的所有树木的动态生长版本，并在暮色森林维度生成世界时完全替换它们。<br>通过 Tree Packs（树包），可以自定义和调整这些树木、其行为以及生成方式。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>特性</strong></h2>\n<h4><strong>当前包含的树木：</strong></h4>\n<ul>\n<li>病态暮光橡树 (Sickly Twilight Oak)</li>\n<li>健壮暮光橡树 (Robust Twilight Oak)</li>\n<li>冠层树 (Canopy Tree)</li>\n<li>红树林树 (Mangrove Tree)</li>\n<li>彩虹橡树 (Rainbow Oak Tree)</li>\n<li>暗木树 (Darkwood Tree)</li>\n<li>时光树 (Tree of Time)</li>\n<li>变形树 (Tree of Transformation)</li>\n<li>分拣树 (Sorting Tree)</li>\n<li>矿工树 (Miner's Tree)</li>\n</ul>\n<h4><strong><br>世界生成：</strong></h4>\n<p>暮色森林维度中的所有生物群系现在都会生成动态树木。<br>这可以通过 Tree-Packs（树包）进行自定义。<br><br></p>\n<h4><strong>魔法树：</strong></h4>\n<p>时光树、变形树、分拣树和矿工树都具备完整的功能，并会执行各自的效果。要获取魔法种子，请使用泥土桶配方来转换你的树苗。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>其他插件</strong></h2>\n<p>其他模组的 Dynamic Trees 插件可以在<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamictrees\" rel=\"nofollow\"> Dynamic Trees CurseForge 页面</a>找到。</p>\n<h4><strong>建议和需求：</strong></h4>\n<p>如需请求新增模组的兼容性支持，请在此处提交！！&nbsp;<br><a href=\"https://github.com/orgs/DynamicTreesTeam/discussions/categories/compatibility-addon-suggestions\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/orgs/DynamicTreesTeam/discussions/categories/compatibility-addon-suggestions</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>前置要求</strong></h2>\n<h5>(1.16.5 / 1.18.2)</h5>\n<h6>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamictrees\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dynamic Trees<br></a>-&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Twilight Forest</a></h6>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"><strong>许可与模组包</strong></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>您可以随意在任何模组包中使用本模组！无需事先询问。<br>本模组采用<strong>MIT</strong>许可证，其源代码在 GitHub 上公开。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h2>",
